              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "RoxAmidon"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Really tasty! I agree the macadamia nuts add crunch, the sesame seeds a nuttiness and the soy sauce adds needed saltiness. We served with pickled ginger and wasabi on the side. We made this for a dinner party and there wasn’t a morsel left. Thanks for the tip of slightly freezing the tuna. Very helpful!",
