              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allyson"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Oh my, how fabulous is this Ahi Tuna. I made it tonight, just for me. :)\nI didn't have macadamia nuts, so I used toasted some sesame seeds. I added just a kiss of wasabi and soy.\nI served with greens, pickled red onion, fresh avocado and rice. \nMy belly is happily content. \n #Allrecipesallstarscanada\n #TasteofSpring\nThank you for sharing.",
